@startuml
actor "Product Owner" as PO
participant System

activate PO

autonumber

PO -> System : select scenario and map
System --> PO : scenario successfully loaded

PO -> System : start simulator
System --> PO : simulator ready

PO -> System : start simulation
activate System
System -> System : identify valid stations (that serve cities/industries)
System -> System : generate cargo based on scenario and nearby entities
System -> System : schedule periodic generation (fixed or random)
System -> System : store cargo at stations (max. 24)

PO -> System : pause simulation
System --> PO : simulation successfully paused
deactivate System
@enduml
